cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, benchmark, or its verified measurements in academic
  work, please cite it. Citation is requested, not required by the license.
title: "Seed Research Appliance and Wakeward Benchmark v2"
abstract: >-
  A research-only appliance for controlled one-shot autonomous-intervention
  experiments. It combines public-packet isolation, exact one-call hosted-model
  adapters, a deterministic counterfactual world kernel, five-seed oracle
  qualification, immutable checksummed artifacts, and intention-to-evaluate
  signal-detection analysis over a six-family engineering benchmark.
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Runkai
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
# version, date-released, doi, and repository-code are filled in at the first
# tagged public release.
